# Temporary Scripts & Backups
#
# Scratch PowerShell at the repo ROOT only. This used to be a blanket *.ps1,
# which swallowed scripts/ipc/ - the IPC probes and acceptance tests that
# CLAUDE.md calls this project's QA infrastructure. Three of them had been
# rescued one at a time with ! lines; that accumulation was the symptom, not
# the fix. Build output under x64/ is still ignored by the rule above, so the
# Release mirror of these scripts stays out.
/*.ps1
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.bak
*.old
*.tmp
ipc_tokens.json
ipc_audit*.jsonl
sertifika.pem
private-key.pem
*.key.pem
_Unused/
_Old/

# Local build logs & test files
build_log*.txt
build_fix_test.txt
*.wsb

# OS specific
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local tool/IDE caches
.claude/
.dotnet_home/
*.hint

# Local work notes (not for repo)
/sculpt_control_graph_todo.md
/vulkan_blas_batch_fix.md
/shared_texture_pool_refactor_plan.md
/docs/dev/mesh_paint_uvless_plan.md

